{"resourceIdentifier":"3282","resourceName":"Solid Waste Management Project at Moradabad","description":"The proposed project involves the establishment of a municipal solid waste (MSW) processing plant in Moradabad, Uttar Pradesh. The project involves aerobic decomposition of biodegradable components of municipal solid waste.\r\nThe waste processing plant would have an aggregated capacity to process 400 tonnes per day (TPD) of waste.\r\nThe purpose of the project is to avoid methane emission through Processing of municipal solid waste in a compost plant that uses controlled aerobic decomposition in a windrow composting process. The process of composting would result in the production of compost that will be supplied to the local agricultural farms","location":{"latitude":28.828920,"longitude":78.807369},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-08-15","endExclusive":"2022-09-15","endInclusive":"2022-09-14"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3282"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Uttar Pradesh"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"HARI BHARI MORADABAD WASTE MANAGEMENT PRIVATE LIMITED"},{"type":"string","value":"Uttar Pradesh, India"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3282"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"52510"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0022"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"05/07/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":